Module A: Running DiD/Event Study simulation.
This experiment simulates a difference-in-differences event study using a dummy panel dataset. 
We simulate panel data with a treatment indicator (based on 'automation-prone' categories post-event) 
and include fixed effects for platform and month. A positive treatment coefficient indicates higher wage change post-treatment.

