Module B: Simulating performance under three assistance conditions: None, Tool, and LLM-CoPilot.
For code tasks, we simulate performance metrics (correctness and time-to-solve) that depend on task complexity and assistance type.
Higher correctness and reduced time-to-solve imply better assistance effectiveness.

